{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07273","headline":"送郑说之歙州谒薛侍郎 · 刘长卿","name":"送郑说之歙州谒薛侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漂泊来千里，讴谣满百城。\n汉家尊太守，鲁国重诸生。\n俗变人难理，江传水至清。\n船经危石住，路入乱山行。\n老得沧州趣，春伤白首情。\n尝闻马南郡，门下有康成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}